# Supabase Postgres (Dashboard -> Connect). Replace [PASSWORD] with your database password.
# Use the POOLER hosts: the direct db.<ref>.supabase.co host is IPv6-only and fails on many networks.
# If the password contains special characters, URL-encode them (@ -> %40, # -> %23, / -> %2F).

# Used by the running app: transaction pooler, port 6543.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres.<project-ref>:[PASSWORD]@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres?pgbouncer=true"

# Used by the Prisma CLI (migrate, studio): session pooler, port 5432.
DIRECT_URL="postgresql://postgres.<project-ref>:[PASSWORD]@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres"

# Chatbot (Tiffee). Claude writes the answers; without this key Tiffee shows the best matching passages instead.
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional: which Claude model answers (default claude-haiku-5-5, the cheapest; claude-opus-5-5 is stronger but ~40x the price).
# CHAT_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
# Optional: most Claude answers one server instance writes per day before Tiffee answers from her notes only (default 1500).
# CHAT_DAILY_LIMIT=1500

# Optional: secret that signs game tickets (/api/questions -> /api/scores). If unset, one is derived from DATABASE_URL.
# GAME_TOKEN_SECRET=

# Chatbot search (Voyage AI embeddings), needed for `npm run ingest` and for Tiffee to look up answers.
# Get a key at https://www.voyageai.com/ . Accounts without a payment method are limited to 3 requests a minute.
VOYAGE_API_KEY=
